// Build settings for Release builds (TestFlight and the App Store).
//
// The hosted Supabase project, once the idea has one (stage alpha): its URL (spelled
// https:/$()/<ref>.supabase.co, since a bare // starts a comment) and its publishable key.
// Both are public by design (row level security protects the data, not the key), so they
// are tracked here. `pnpm release` refuses to ship while they are empty or local.
//
// Local.xcconfig comes first: it can supply the signing team, but the two values below
// win over it, so the local stack's key can never end up in a release.
#include? "Local.xcconfig"

SUPABASE_URL =
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY =
